sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Ap as Manager
  participant API as RequestsController.Decide
  participant WF as WorkflowService
  participant DB as Azure SQL
  participant NS as NotificationService
  Ap->>API: POST /api/requests/{id}/decision {approved, notes}
  API->>API: Policy CanApprove (Manager) and Auditor write-block
  API->>WF: DecideAsync
  WF->>DB: Load request
  alt Not found
    API-->>Ap: 404 Not Found
  else Not an access request, or not UnderReview
    API-->>Ap: 400 Bad Request
  else Allowed
    WF->>DB: One SaveChanges: Approved / Rejected + RowVersion<br/>+ RequestAudit (UnderReview → new status)
    alt Concurrency token changed (competing decision)
      WF-->>API: ConcurrentTransitionException (rolled back with its audit row)
      API-->>Ap: 400 Bad Request
    else Committed
      WF->>NS: RequesterApproved / RequesterRejected
      API-->>Ap: 200 OK RequestResponse
    end
  end
  Note over API,WF: Not checked: caller is the routed manager, or self-approval. Notes are not stored.
